Package: GSVAdata
Title: Data employed in the vignette of the GSVA package
Version: 1.49.2
Author: Robert Castelo <robert.castelo@upf.edu>
Description: This package stores the data employed in the vignette of the GSVA package. These data belong to the following publications: Cahoy et al. J Neurosci 28:264-278, 2008; Carrel and Willard, Nature, 434:400-404, 2005; Huang et al. PNAS, 104:9758-9763, 2007; Pickrell et al. Nature, 464:768-722, 2010; Skaletsky et al. Nature, 423:825-837; Verhaak et al. Cancer Cell 17:98-110, 2010; Costa et al. FEBS J, 288:2311-2331, 2021.
Maintainer: Robert Castelo <robert.castelo@upf.edu>
Depends: R (>= 4.0), Biobase, GSEABase, SummarizedExperiment
Imports: methods, utils, Matrix, SpatialExperiment
License: Artistic-2.0
biocViews: ExperimentData, ExpressionData, SequencingData, Homo_sapiens_Data, CancerData, Tissue
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
